function groupSearchResults(data,detail,needle){const groups={Boards:[],Tickets:[],Agents:[]},seenTickets=new Set(),q=String(needle||'').trim().toLocaleLowerCase();if(!q)return groups;for(const [central,d] of Object.entries(data)){for(const b of d.boards||[]){if(matches([central,b.label,b.board_id],q))groups.Boards.push({label:b.label,meta:`${central} · ${b.board_id}`,href:boardHref(central,b.board_id)});for(const t of b.tickets||[]){if(ticketMatches(t,q)){const key=`${central}/${b.board_id}/${t.id}`;seenTickets.add(key);groups.Tickets.push({label:t.title||t.id,meta:`${t.id} · ${central} · ${b.board_id}`,href:ticketHref(central,b.board_id,t.id)})}}}for(const a of d.agents||[])if(matches([central,a.agent_name,a.pool_status,...(a.boards||[])],q)){const key=`agent:${central}:${a.agent_name}`;groups.Agents.push({label:a.agent_name,meta:`${central} · ${a.pool_status} · ${(a.boards||[]).join(', ')}`,href:'#/',stateKey:key})}}if(detail?.central&&detail?.board?.board_id)for(const t of detail.tickets||[]){const key=`${detail.central}/${detail.board.board_id}/${t.id}`;if(!seenTickets.has(key)&&ticketMatches(t,q))groups.Tickets.push({label:t.title||t.id,meta:`${t.id} · ${detail.central} · ${detail.board.board_id}`,href:ticketHref(detail.central,detail.board.board_id,t.id)})}return groups}
function renderSearchResults(){const host=document.querySelector('#search-results'),input=document.querySelector('#filter'),groups=groupSearchResults(fleetData,detailData,filterNeedle);searchItems=Object.values(groups).flat();searchSelection=Math.min(searchSelection,Math.max(0,searchItems.length-1));host.innerHTML=Object.entries(groups).filter(([,items])=>items.length).map(([name,items])=>`<section><h3>${esc(name)}</h3>${items.map(item=>{const index=searchItems.indexOf(item);return `<a id="search-option-${index}" class="search-result" role="option" aria-selected="${index===searchSelection}" data-search-index="${index}" href="${esc(item.href)}"><b>${esc(item.label)}</b><span class="meta">${esc(item.meta)}</span></a>`}).join('')}</section>`).join('')||(filterNeedle?'<p class="empty">No results</p>':'');host.hidden=!filterNeedle;input.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!host.hidden));if(!host.hidden&&searchItems.length)input.setAttribute('aria-activedescendant',`search-option-${searchSelection}`);else input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant')}
function closeSearchResults(returnFocus=false){const host=document.querySelector('#search-results'),input=document.querySelector('#filter');host.hidden=true;input.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');if(returnFocus)input.focus()}
function jumpSearchResult(index){const item=searchItems[index];if(!item)return;closeSearchResults();if(item.stateKey){location.hash=item.href;sectionStates.set(item.stateKey,true);setTimeout(()=>{renderFleet();const target=[...document.querySelectorAll('details[data-state-key]')].find(x=>x.dataset.stateKey===item.stateKey);target?.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});target?.focus()},0)}else location.hash=item.href}
function handleDashboardKeydown(e){const input=document.querySelector('#filter'),results=document.querySelector('#search-results'),help=document.querySelector('#help-overlay'),editing=['INPUT','TEXTAREA','SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName);if(e.key==='Escape'){if(!results.hidden||document.activeElement===input){e.preventDefault();closeSearchResults(true);return}if(help.open){e.preventDefault();help.close();document.querySelector('#help-toggle').focus()}return}if(e.key==='?'&&!editing){e.preventDefault();help.showModal();return}if(e.key==='/'&&!editing){e.preventDefault();input.focus();if(filterNeedle)renderSearchResults();return}if(document.activeElement===input&&['ArrowDown','ArrowUp'].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();if(!filterNeedle||!searchItems.length)return;searchSelection=Math.max(0,Math.min(searchItems.length-1,searchSelection+(e.key==='ArrowDown'?1:-1)));renderSearchResults();return}if(document.activeElement===input&&e.key==='Enter'&&!results.hidden&&searchItems.length){e.preventDefault();jumpSearchResult(searchSelection);return}if(editing)return;if(goPrefix){clearTimeout(goTimer);goPrefix=false;if(e.key==='f')location.hash='#/';if(e.key==='r'){const current=route();if(current?.kind==='board')location.hash=boardHref(current.central,current.board,'routes')}if(e.key==='o')location.hash=centralHref(defaultCentral,'overhead');if(e.key==='c')location.hash=centralHref(defaultCentral,'config');if(e.key==='w')location.hash=centralHref(defaultCentral,'workers');return}if(e.key==='g'){goPrefix=true;goTimer=setTimeout(()=>{goPrefix=false},800)}}
function bindInteractive(root=document){for(const item of root.querySelectorAll('details[data-state-key]')){const key=item.dataset.stateKey;if(sectionStates.has(key))item.open=sectionStates.get(key);item.addEventListener('toggle',()=>sectionStates.set(key,item.open))}}
function announceState(message){if(!message||message===lastAnnouncement)return;lastAnnouncement=message;document.querySelector('#live-state').textContent=message}
const connectionRecoveryHint='Check Central URL: remote Central must use https:// (http:// is loopback-only); verify token scope, then retry.';
const connectionFailureDetail=error=>{const candidate=String(error?.connectionClass||error?.name||'ConnectionError');return{errorClass:/^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,63}$/.test(candidate)?candidate:'ConnectionError',hint:connectionRecoveryHint}};
const connectionBannerText=(lastSuccess,failure)=>`reconnecting… last success ${lastSuccess?new Date(lastSuccess).toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',second:'2-digit'}):'never'} · Last error: ${failure?.errorClass||'ConnectionError'}. ${failure?.hint||connectionRecoveryHint}`;
function updateConnectionState(){const banner=document.querySelector('#connection-banner'),failure=[...connectionFailureDetails.values()].at(-1),failed=!!connectionFailures.size;banner.hidden=!failed;banner.textContent=failed?connectionBannerText(lastSuccessAt,failure):'';if(failed&&!connectionWasUnavailable){connectionWasUnavailable=true;announceState('Connection interrupted. Reconnecting.')}else if(!failed&&connectionWasUnavailable){connectionWasUnavailable=false;announceState('Connection restored.')}}
